<div id="pf3a" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="3a"><div class="pc pc3a w0 h0"><img class="bi x0 ye81 w1 h4b" alt="" src="bg3a.png"/><div class="t m0 x4 hb y33 ff9 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">6<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _13"> </span>大数据环境下的优化算法</span></div><div class="t m0 xc hf y14 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第<span class="_ _d"> </span><span class="ff6">6<span class="_ _d"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _d"> </span><span class="ff9 fc6"><span class="_ _f"> </span></span>大数据环境下的优化算法</div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y15 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">本章将介绍在大规模数据集（大数据）环境下，经典优化算法所面临的挑战以及应运而生的随机优化算法。</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 y16 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">我们将从随机梯<span class="_ _1"></span>度下降法<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff3">(SGD)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>出发，深入探讨其收<span class="_ _1"></span>敛性理论，并介绍<span class="_ _1"></span>一系列在现代机器<span class="_ _1"></span>学习中广泛应用的<span class="_ _1"></span>改</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 y17 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">进算法，如<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">Momentum,<span class="_ _0"> </span>A<span class="_ _3"></span>daGrad,<span class="_ _0"> </span>RMSProp<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">和<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>A<span class="_ _3"></span>dam<span class="ff4">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xf h10 ye82 ff9 fs4 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff6">6.1<span class="_ _5f"> </span><span class="ff1">随机梯度下降法<span class="_ _e"> </span></span>(Stochastic<span class="_ _20"> </span>Gradient<span class="_ _8"> </span>Descent)</span></div><div class="t m0 xf h16 ye83 ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.1.1<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">大规模数据瓶颈：以点击率预测为例</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 ye84 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">在许多机器<span class="_ _1"></span>学习应用中，例<span class="_ _1"></span>如推荐系统或<span class="_ _1"></span>在线广告平台<span class="_ _1"></span>的点击率<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff3">(CTR) </span>预测，我们面临的数<span class="_ _1"></span>据规模极其庞</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 ye85 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">大。</div><div class="t m0 xe h6 ye86 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">6.1.1</span></div><div class="t m0 x10 h11 ye87 ffa fs1 fc9 sc0 ls0 ws0">♣</div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 yd21 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">以逻辑回归为例，模型<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑝<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _15"></span></span>𝑦<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffa">|<span class="_ _1"></span></span></span></span>𝑥<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffb">;<span class="_ _10"> </span></span>𝜃<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _2"> </span></span></span>和对数似然损失函数<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">L<span class="_ _12"></span>(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _1"></span></span>)<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>定义如下：</div><div class="t m0 x3f h11 ye88 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑝<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _15"></span></span>𝑦</div><div class="t m0 x5c h14 ye89 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 xdb h11 ye88 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="ffa">|<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ff8">𝑥</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x76 h14 ye89 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x119 h11 ye88 ffb fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">;<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _2"> </span></span></span>𝜎<span class="_ _12"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span>𝜃</span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 h14 ye8a ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 x4a h12 ye88 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x32 h14 ye89 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x12a h11 ye88 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=</span></div><div class="t m0 x92 h7 ye8b ffb fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1</div><div class="t m0 xfb h11 ye8c ffb fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑒</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xbe h15 ye8d ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">−<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝜃</span></div><div class="t m0 x94 h21 ye8e ff14 fs7 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 x44 h14 ye8d ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑥</div><div class="t m0 xc0 h21 ye8f ff14 fs7 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x46 h11 ye90 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">L<span class="_ _12"></span>(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>−</div><div class="t m0 x49 h7 ye91 ffb fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1</div><div class="t m0 x75 h12 ye92 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 x4a h14 ye93 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 xf7 h18 ye94 fff fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"></div><div class="t m0 x38 h14 ye95 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffd">=<span class="ffb">1</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x42 h12 ye90 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑙</div><div class="t m0 xb6 h14 ye96 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x43 h11 ye90 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 ye97 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算瓶颈：<span class="ff4">在传统梯度下降法<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(GD)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>中，每次参数更新都需要计算全量梯度<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Full-batch<span class="_ _c"> </span>Gradient)</span>：</span></div><div class="t m0 x91 h11 ye98 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">∇</div><div class="t m0 xb0 h14 ye99 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜃</div><div class="t m0 x46 h11 ye98 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">L<span class="_ _12"></span>(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>−</div><div class="t m0 x49 h7 ye9a ffb fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1</div><div class="t m0 x75 h12 ye9b ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 x4a h14 ye9c ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 xf7 h18 y2fd fff fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"></div><div class="t m0 x38 h14 ye9d ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffd">=<span class="ffb">1</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x42 h11 ye98 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">∇</div><div class="t m0 x63 h14 ye99 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜃</div><div class="t m0 x4c h12 ye98 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑙</div><div class="t m0 xe3 h14 ye99 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 xad h11 ye98 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 ye9e ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">当<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑁<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>达到数十亿（如广<span class="_ _1"></span>告样本）且特征维度<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑑<span class="_ _20"> </span></span>达到数百万时，<span class="_ _1"></span>遍历所有样本计算<span class="_ _1"></span>一次梯度<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">∇</span></div><div class="t m0 xf4 h14 ye9f ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜃</div><div class="t m0 xc4 h6 ye9e ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">L<span class="_ _12"></span>(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝜃<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff4">的计</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 yea0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">算与内存开销极大，导致单次更新耗时过长，算法不具备实用性。</div><div class="t m0 xf h16 yea1 ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.1.2<span class="_ _21"> </span>SGD<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff1">算法定义</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 yea2 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">随机梯度下降法<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff3">(SGD) </span>通过牺牲单次更新的精<span class="_ _1"></span>度来换取极高的更<span class="_ _1"></span>新速度，从而解决了<span class="_ _1"></span>大规模数据下的<span class="_ _1"></span>计算</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 yea3 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">瓶颈。</div><div class="t m0 x4 hb y62 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _36"> </span><span class="fc6"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">53<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _36"> </span><span class="fc8"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
